        <Property name="Text" value="Turn on Realistic physics. S2 = RAISE (position b), S1 = LOWER (position a), release = hold.&#xA;1V2 = counterbalance valve: pilot-operated 2/2 valve set to 3.2 bar (pilot from the cap end) with bypass check valve 1V3." />
